## System Architecture

```mermaid
graph TD
    CopPeer[Cop Peer - FastMCP HTTP] <-->|P2P JSON-RPC| ThiefPeer[Thief Peer - FastMCP HTTP]
    CopPeer --> CopOrchestrator[Police Orchestrator]
    ThiefPeer --> ThiefOrchestrator[Thief Orchestrator]
    
    CopOrchestrator --> BayesianBelief[Bayesian Belief Grid & Scent Engine]
    CopOrchestrator --> CommitReveal[Cryptographic SHA-256 Commit-Reveal Engine]
    CopOrchestrator --> Gatekeeper[Rate Limiter & Gatekeeper]
    CopOrchestrator --> Watchdog[Watchdog & Deadline Tracker]
    CopOrchestrator --> LiveGUI[Live Heatmap & Replay Verifier]
    CopOrchestrator --> GmailReporter[Gmail API Automated Reporter]
```

