## Pre-Submission Verification Checklist

| Requirement | Implementation Status | Verified Component |
| :--- | :--- | :--- |
| **Logic & Physics** | ✅ Complete | Grid movement, 14 static barriers, capture mechanics |
| **Dec-POMDP P2P Server** | ✅ Complete | FastMCP (`police_thief_peer`), HTTP/JSON-RPC transport |
| **Security & Non-Repudiation**| ✅ Complete | 4-Stage SHA-256 Commit-Reveal Protocol (`CommitmentScheme`) |
| **Dynamic Scent & Belief** | ✅ Complete | Radial scent decay ($\rho=0.10$), Bayesian belief map updates |
| **Dual Agent Strategy** | ✅ Complete | `PoliceBrain` (pursuit), `ThiefBrain` (evasion & deception) |
| **Reliability & Gatekeeper** | ✅ Complete | Watchdog process monitor, Token Bucket rate limiter |
| **Live GUI & Replay Verifier** | ✅ Complete | Heatmap visualizer, step-by-step cryptographic audit |
| **Automated Gmail Reporter** | ✅ Complete | OAuth 2.0 signed artifact compiler (`declaration_police.json`, etc.) |
